config KVM_USB_MONITOR_EVAL
    bool "USB extended monitor evaluation profile"
    depends on KVM_UI_PLATFORM
    depends on TINYUSB_HID_COUNT = 4
    default n
    help
        Offer the Espressif USB extended monitor in Extensions. Opening the
        monitor switches the USB port from HID to the display-only device.
        Home closes the monitor and restores the normal HID configuration.
        Use sdkconfig.usb-monitor-eval to configure the vendor endpoints and HID control-transfer handling together.
